  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support private sector and resilience in Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to strengthened capabilities, enhanced b2b cooperation and improved business enabling conditions for Ukrainian MSMEs. This is to be achieved through: 1) Strengthening capabilities of Ukraine&#x2019;s entrepreneurs representing creative industries for digitalization and internationalization, cooperation with Czech businesses in particular: a capacity building programme focused on digitalization and internationalization for creative industries prioritizing cooperation with Czech businesses and including series of online workshops and webinars as well as dedicated knowledge products. 2) Enhancing connections and cooperation of Ukrainian companies and business support organizations with foreign counterparts, Czech in particular: matchmaking between Ukrainian and foreign MSMEs and business support organizations, Czech in particular, trade missions, experience exchange visits and other events to promote cooperation 3) Improving business enabling conditions and opportunities for public-private dialogue: digital tools to facilitate public-private dialogue with the solution enabling the draft regulations impact analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
